      "message": "Thank you for reviewing this change.\n\nThis patch addresses the inconsistency where refs/meta/config could be deleted via the single-ref path (deleteSingleRef), while it was already blocked in the multi-ref path.\n\nI am not monitoring private messages related to this change. Please keep all discussion on this Gerrit change or on the repo-discuss mailing list so that the conversation remains public and useful for other contributors.",
