      "writtenOn": "2026-08-19T10:28:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This change adds the missing isConfigRef() guard to deleteSingleRef().\n\nPreviously, the protection against deleting refs/meta/config existed only\nin the multi-ref path (createDeleteCommand). When a single ref was\nsupplied, deleteMultipleRefs() delegated to deleteSingleRef(), bypassing\nthe check.\n\nThis aligns the single-ref path with the existing multi-ref protection\nand closes the inconsistency reported on repo-discuss.",
      "revId": "67a0270dc3a8ae5e53323c99518f98c085850b65",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
